<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JUVENTUS WIN WORLD CLUB CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS WIN WORLD CLUB CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy beat River Plate of Argentina 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the World Club Cup final on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Alessandro Del Piero 82.</p>
</text>
